# CanRepeatModes$ (CharmEffect.java:228-237, PlayerControllerHuman.java:1996):
# Fiery Confluence picks "2 damage to each opponent" twice and "1 damage to each
# creature" once. "Destroy target artifact" has no legal target, so only two
# modes are offered (indices 0 and 1) and three choices still stand. The AI
# takes 4 and its Llanowar Elves dies.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue modechoice 1,1,0
castspell human 1
resolvestack
